        "created_at": "2015-12-22T00:24:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My main reasoning is Stun Bolts.</p><p>\"Whenever this attack resolves. . .\"</p><p>That puts the timing past when the defender would have to use a defense -1 token. &nbsp;I think if they meant the same effect with Hack and Slash they would have used similar wording.</p>",
